"Connection details & more" = "连接详情与更多操作";
"Forget this Mac?" = "要忘记这台 Mac 吗？";
"Forget Mac" = "忘记 Mac";
"Keep this Mac" = "保留";
"This phone stops showing %@'s sessions and alerts. To connect again you need the pairing code from that Mac." = "这台手机将不再显示 %@ 的会话和提醒。要重新连接，需要那台 Mac 上的配对码。";
"Remote connection active" = "远程已连接";
"Scan your Mac’s remote code, then check your connection. Works with Headscale, Tailscale or Surge." = "扫描 Mac 的远程配对码，再检查连接。支持 Headscale、Tailscale 和 Surge。";
"Your Mac, wherever you are" = "不在 Mac 身边，也能跟进任务";
"Scan your Mac’s remote code, prepare your phone’s network, then check and save. Your current pairing stays saved until live status arrives." = "扫描 Mac 的远程配对码，准备手机网络，再检查并保存。收到实时状态前，保留现有配对。";
"1. Get your Mac’s connection info" = "1. 获取 Mac 连接信息";
"Scan remote pairing code" = "扫描远程配对码";
"Scan again" = "重新扫码";
"On your Mac, open Devices & connection, choose Away from Mac, then Show connection code. VibeBuddy detects the remote address automatically; enter it manually if needed." = "在 Mac 打开「设备与连接」，选择「在外连接」，再点「显示连接二维码」。VibeBuddy 会自动识别远程地址，必要时可手动设置。";
"Pairing info received. Check the connection to finish." = "已取得配对信息，检查连接后才完成。";
"Mac private IP" = "Mac 远程 IP";
"Use the Mac’s Tailscale IPv4 address, not the Headscale server URL or Surge node address." = "填写 Mac 的 Tailscale IPv4 地址，这里不填 Headscale 服务器网址或 Surge 节点地址。";
"Scan the Mac’s code to get pairing authorization. You can continue here after scanning." = "扫描 Mac 的配对码以取得授权，扫码后可直接在此继续。";
"This Mac’s pairing authorization will be reused." = "继续使用这台 Mac 的配对授权。";
"Enter the Mac’s address from 100.64.0.0 to 100.127.255.255 and a valid port. A local Wi-Fi address cannot be used here." = "请填写 Mac 在 100.64.0.0 至 100.127.255.255 范围内的地址及有效端口。这里不能使用局域网地址。";
"2. Prepare your phone’s network" = "2. 准备手机网络";
"Network app" = "网络 App";
"Network setup steps" = "网络设置步骤";
"In Surge, add a Tailscale policy with your Headscale control-url and sign in. Confirm the Mac’s private IP uses this policy. Current Surge versions add routes for discovered devices automatically." = "在 Surge 中添加 Tailscale 策略，填写 Headscale 的 control-url 并登录。确认 Mac 的私网 IP 通过该策略连接。新版 Surge 会自动为已发现的设备添加路由。";
"In the Tailscale app, sign in to the same network as your Mac. If you use Headscale, choose your Headscale server before signing in. Keep Tailscale connected." = "在 Tailscale App 中登录与 Mac 相同的网络。使用 Headscale 时，先选择你的 Headscale 服务器再登录，并保持 Tailscale 连接。";
"Tailscale and Headscale setup" = "Tailscale 与 Headscale 设置指南";
"Keep VibeBuddy and Tailscale running on the Mac, with incoming connections allowed. Sign-in happens in your network app; VibeBuddy checks the connection." = "Mac 需保持 VibeBuddy 和 Tailscale 运行，并允许传入连接。登录授权在网络 App 中完成，VibeBuddy 负责检查连接。";
"Check and save" = "检查并保存";
"Cancel check" = "取消检查";
"3. Check live Mac status" = "3. 检查 Mac 实时状态";
"The address is saved only after your Mac accepts the pairing and sends live status. A failed or cancelled check keeps your saved pairing." = "Mac 接受配对并返回实时状态后才保存地址。检查失败或取消时，保留已保存的配对。";
"Live Mac status received" = "已收到 Mac 实时状态";
"The remote address is saved. Turn off Wi-Fi, keep your remote network connected, then check again to confirm cellular access." = "已保存远程地址。关闭 Wi-Fi，保持远程网络连接，再检查一次，确认蜂窝网络也能访问。";
"Your Watch receives status through this iPhone. Turn off Wi-Fi, keep your remote network connected and open VibeBuddy to check a live task on both devices. A suspended iPhone may leave the Watch showing its last update; background alerts depend on push delivery." = "Watch 通过这台 iPhone 获取状态。关闭 Wi-Fi，保持远程网络连接，打开 VibeBuddy，在手机和手表上核对实时任务。iPhone 应用被挂起时，手表可能只显示上次更新；后台提醒依赖推送送达。";
"Mac refused this pairing. Scan its current code, then check again. Your saved pairing has not changed." = "Mac 拒绝了这次配对。请扫描它当前的配对码，再重新检查。已保存的配对未改变。";
"Could not receive live Mac status. Check your phone’s remote network, wake the Mac, and confirm VibeBuddy and Tailscale allow incoming connections. Your saved pairing has not changed." = "暂时未收到 Mac 实时状态。请检查手机的远程网络，唤醒 Mac，并确认 VibeBuddy 与 Tailscale 允许传入连接。已保存的配对未改变。";
"The saved pairing changed during this check. Check again before saving this address." = "检查期间，已保存的配对发生了变化。请重新检查后再保存此地址。";

